# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout,
# regardless of platform or local core.autocrlf setting. Fixes the
# repo-wide CRLF drift on Windows checkouts (nearly every tracked file
# showed as "modified" purely from line-ending differences, with no
# real content change -- see AUDIT_NOTES.md, 2026-08-29).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch files conventionally want CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Explicit binary declarations (belt-and-suspenders on top of
# text=auto's content-based detection) so these are never
# line-ending-normalized or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
